==============================================================================
F. block construction of 1.3 (gamma = 1, minus sheet)
==============================================================================
W_L = words of length L, o_L = ceil(L/alpha) + 1 odd letters, all partial sums <= 0;
c_L(W) = -max over W_L and 1<=i<=L of S_i ; c_L(theory) = min{o alpha - i > 0 : 1<=i<=L, 0<=o<=i};
n_2(L) = (3/2)^L/(2^c_L - 1) is where n 2^c_L - (3/2)^L >= n starts to hold (first block).
